  "assumptions": [
    "Released POs are counted where PO Status equals Printed and both PM Approve Date and Buyer Approve Date are present.",
    "Delay aging is calculated from Requisition PM Approve Date to Requisition Buyer Approve Date. PO Date is used only for monthly grouping.",
    "Business hours exclude weekends and the region-specific 2026 holiday list. Same Day means business hours are less than 24; delay days equal full 24-hour business periods.",
    "Weekend rules used: USA/Canada/Dubai exclude Saturday and Sunday; Saudi excludes Friday and Saturday.",
    "PO amount totals are reported-value sums from the source files and are not converted between currencies.",
    "Monthly average requisitions are calculated as released requisitions divided by business days in the month, excluding the region-specific weekends and 2026 holiday dates.",
    "Monthly overall percentage is each month's released requisitions divided by total released requisitions for the selected region.",
    "Full process time is intended to track Requisition Create Date to PM Approve Date to Buyer Approve Date. Current uploaded JSON only contains aggregated PM-to-Buyer timing, so create-to-PM timing will populate when the source CSV rows are included in the next data refresh.",
    "Delayed requisitions listed at the bottom are requisitions delayed 1+ business day based on full 24-hour business periods between PM approval and Buyer approval."
